SIEM Setup with ELK Stack
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Install and configure the ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana) on Linux
Integrate Wazuh for host-based intrusion detection and log collection
Develop a Python script to automate log aggregation and analysis
Create custom Kibana dashboards for security event visualization
Analyze security logs and identify potential threats using SIEM tools
Prerequisites
Basic Linux command line proficiency
Understanding of system logs and log formats
Familiarity with JSON data structures
Basic Python programming knowledge
Understanding of network security concepts
